  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A maintenance release. On Umbraco 16 the pinned System.Security.Cryptography.Xml moves from 9.0.19 to 10.0.12; the package does not use the library and pins it only because Umbraco brings in a vulnerable version transitively. Umbraco 17 and 18 sites resolve the same versions as 0.5.1. No API, configuration or schema changes, and the generated service worker and client script are unchanged. Full changelog: https://github.com/BaryoDev/umbraco-pwa/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
